  "description": "Legend Western is a bold vintage western display font inspired by classic cowboy signs, old frontier posters, rustic saloons, and traditional Western Americana typography. Its strong, chunky letterforms give your designs a powerful and authentic Old West character.\nPerfect for cowboy branding, rodeo posters, western logos, ranch designs, saloon signage, country merchandise, T-shirt designs, badges, labels, posters, packaging, stickers, and vintage apparel. The bold construction makes it highly visible and ideal for headlines, while its Western character adds a timeless rustic feel.\nWhether you’re creating a cowboy logo, rodeo artwork, ranch branding, Western poster, or vintage T-shirt, Legend Western brings an authentic frontier atmosphere to your designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Legend Western is a bold vintage western display font inspired by classic cowboy signs, old frontier posters, rustic saloons, and traditional Western Americana typography. Its strong, chunky letterforms give your designs a powerful and authentic Old West character.</p>\n<p>Perfect for cowboy branding, rodeo posters, western logos, ranch designs, saloon signage, country merchandise, T-shirt designs, badges, labels, posters, packaging, stickers, and vintage apparel. The bold construction makes it highly visible and ideal for headlines, while its Western character adds a timeless rustic feel.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating a cowboy logo, rodeo artwork, ranch branding, Western poster, or vintage T-shirt, Legend Western brings an authentic frontier atmosphere to your designs.</p>",
